## Remediation Strategy
Enforce strict zero-trust parameters on all incoming client-side stream requests. Real-time balance calculations, updates, and wallet settlements must never rely on integer frames transmitted or defined by the client application layer. The backend system must use transactional cryptographic signatures to sync balances between the primary financial ledger database and isolated third-party gameplay sessions.
